      "title": "Escala e latência",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transcrições por réplica (F8)",
      "description": "Carga dividida entre as réplicas do worker",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (increase(voxticket_transcription_processed_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência HTTP p95 por serviço",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {},
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Traces e logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Traces:** Explore → Tempo → busque por `service.name` ou pelo atributo `messaging.message.conversation_id` (= requestId). Um pedido atravessa request → quota → transcription → categorization → ticket → notification.\n\n**Logs:** Explore → Loki → `{service_name=\"request-service\"}`; clique no `trace_id` para pular para o trace."
      }
    }
  ],
